<title>USA: Whittaker Corp Q2 April 30 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Whittaker Corp Q2 April 30 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>($ in 000, except for per-share data)</p>
<p>					    Q2		 Six Months</p>
<p>				    1997	1996     1997	1996</p>
<p> Sales			   44,732   47,605    94,787   92,025</p>
<p>Goodwill and other</p>
<p>intangibles impairment</p>
<p>     charge		    22,068	 --    22,068	 --</p>
<p>Acquired in-process research</p>
<p>     and development	     --   11,700	  --   11,700</p>
<p>    Restructuring costs	  --	540     5,268	540</p>
<p> Operating Loss	    (29,164) (11,281)  (43,551)  (6,591)</p>
<p> Benefit for taxes		 --  (3,007)	  --  (1,701)</p>
<p> Net loss		    (34,443)  (4,890)  (52,526)  (3,000)</p>
<p>Average common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>  outstanding (000)	  11,149    9,471    11,131    9,136</p>
<p> Net loss per share	  (3.09)   (0.52)    (4.72)   (0.33)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 and six months 1997 net includes $1.98/shr charge for impairment of goodwill and other intangibles acquired in purchase of Hughes LAN systems.</p>
<p>Six months 1997 net includes $0.47/shr restructure costs.</p>
<p>Six months 1997 net includes one-time charges of $0.43/shr related to streamlining and intergration activities.</p>
<p>Q2 and six months 1996 net includes $0.75/shr charge for write-off of in-process research and development acquired.</p>
